id=BitPerfect.module
name=BitPerfect Universal Audio Engine
version=v5.4-Universal
versionCode=504
author=Kostyantyn Matviyevskyy aka kostyamat & Antigravity (c)2026
description=Bit-to-bit audio for QF001/K706. v5.4 repairs TTS playback by restoring physical SC2730 DAC speaker switches, expands audio policy formats and sample rates (16-bit + 24-bit 8..48kHz) across fast, primary input/output, and Speaker, routes normal and recognition mic capture to unprocessed ALSA device 0 without DSP lock, adds qf_audio_route_has_i2s.xml, and stops the background volume watchdog from fighting system audio controls.
